      "short_description": "Natixis Investment Managers is a global asset management firm and a part of the French banking group Groupe BPCE. Founded in 2006, it ranks among the top 20 asset managers worldwide, managing \u20ac1,317 billion in assets as of December 31, 2024. The firm operates through a multi-affiliate model, connecting clients with over 15 independent investment managers.\n\nThe company offers a range of investment solutions tailored to meet specific client objectives. These include direct indexing, tax management strategies, multi-asset portfolios, institutional overlay services, and portfolio construction consulting. Additionally, Natixis Investment Managers specializes in managing real assets private debt across sectors such as real estate and infrastructure. With a global presence in Europe, Asia, and the United States, the firm serves institutions, individuals, and distributors, employing over 700 people across its operations.",
